      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 7. Each agency head shall submit by June 15, 1990 and June 15 of each successive year an annual agency overtime control plan to the Mayor's Office of Operations. The plan should outline initiatives that the agency will implement during the fiscal year to monitor and control overtime use and distribution. Each subsequent plan should review and evaluate the previous year's initiatives.",
