      "text": "Section 8. Each agency head shall include in the Monthly Executive Management Plan and Report the total overtime expenditures and hours for the agency, by bureau, unit or division, and shall also set forth any and all special circumstances which account for any variances in the indicators. In addition, the report should identify any anticipated need for recurring or prolonged overtime.",
