      "text": "Section 9. Each agency head shall provide a quarterly report to the Mayor's Office of Operations indicating any and all special circumstances which made it necessary to authorize overtime during the quarter to any employee in excess of 20 percent of the employee's quarterly base salary in overtime. The report shall include each such employee's name, title, length of service, eligibility for retirement, current base salary and amount of overtime compensation received for the current fiscal year to date (quarterly and cumulatively), by bureau, unit or division.",
